 * probability at least 1 - delta,
 *   mu - mean_n <= sigma_n sqrt(2 rho_n log(5/delta) / n)
 *                  + kappa (b - a) log(5/delta) / n,
 * with kappa = 7/3 + 3/sqrt(2) and the Serfling factor
 *   rho_n = 1 - (n-1)/N            for n <= N/2,
 *   rho_n = (1 - n/N)(1 + 1/n)     otherwise.
